	(text "AIN3: general 0..3.3 V input, 1k + 100n low-pass, clamped. Terminal: 3V3 / AIN3 / GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "037ec7c1-e3fc-4cbd-ad52-f6e9ffa1ba7c")
	)
	(text "On-board pH front end: glass electrode on BNC centre, reference on BNC shell. The probe is\nbiased to PH_REF = 1.25 V (TL431 2.495 V / 2), so AIN0 reads 1.25 V +/- 59 mV/pH single-ended;\naquaPi's 2-point calibration removes the offset. BNC shell pads must stay on PH_REF, NOT GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 90.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1a7784de-9a73-4ffe-b60c-8cd1b3c08794")
	)
	(text "TL431B (TI, DBZ pinout 1=K 2=REF 3=A; TL432 differs!), ~1.6 mA via 470R. Divided and buffered\nto PH_REF = 1.25 V, which also drives the probe reference electrode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 186.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3c1adbb3-3a96-4bf4-8643-c877a90f38ba")
	)
	(text "Probe load: only the TLV9062 input (0.5 pA typ). No capacitor or clamp on PH_BNC/PH_IN - their\nleakage would load the probe. 50 Hz filter after the buffer: 10k/10u, 1.6 Hz, about -30 dB at 50 Hz.\nLAYOUT: guard ring around PH_BNC, R45 and U6 pin 3, connected to PH_BUF; short traces; clean flux."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 138.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c31587f-974b-474f-a6f1-7469de9da943")
	)
	(text "AIN2: external pH amplifier module (probe kit board), terminal +5V / SIG / GND. The module\noutput (about 2.5 V at pH 7) is filtered 10k/10u (1.6 Hz) and clamped to 0..3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 194.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9b2ff272-985c-4eca-85de-842ce17950f5")
	)
	(text "ADS1115 on 3.3 V, I2C address 0x48 (JP 1-2, default) or 0x49 (2-3). ALERT/RDY unused.\nAll channels are read single-ended (aquaPi driver): AIN0 on-board pH, AIN1 pH reference\n(monitor, allows AIN0-AIN1 differential later), AIN2 external pH amplifier module, AIN3 general."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bc179ac8-12be-4514-83b1-558afd15ecab")
	)
